\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\f0\fs22\lang9 Ph\f1\lang1066\u7847?n A \f2\emdash  Process\par
\b\f0\lang1033 1. \f2\lang1066 Tr\f3\u432?\f1\u7901?ng n\f0\lang1033\'e0o c\f1\lang1066\u7911?a PCB kh\f0\lang1033\'f4ng hi\f1\lang1066\u7875?n th\u7883?? V\f0\lang1033\'ec sao kh\'f3 l\f1\lang1066\u7845?y t\u7915? l\u7899?p Process c\u7911?a .NET?\b0\par
C\f0\lang1033\'e1c tr\f3\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7901?ng c\u7845?u tr\f0\lang1033\'fac n\f1\lang1066\u7897?i b\u7897? c\u7845?p th\u7845?p c\u7911?a h\u7879? \f3\'f0i\f1\u7873?u h\f0\lang1033\'e0nh nh\f3\u432? con tr\f1\lang1066\u7887? qu\u7843?n l\f0\lang1033\'fd b\f1\lang1066\u7897? nh\u7899? trang (Page Directory/Page Tables), danh s\f0\lang1033\'e1ch c\'e1c Descriptor Table, ho\f1\lang1066\u7863?c tr\u7841?ng th\f0\lang1033\'e1i thanh ghi ph\f1\lang1066\u7847?n c\u7913?ng chi ti\u7871?t c\u7911?a PCB th\f3\u432?\f1\u7901?ng kh\f0\lang1033\'f4ng hi\f1\lang1066\u7875?n th\u7883?.\par
Nguy\f0\lang1033\'ean nh\'e2n l\'e0 do .NET Framework ch\f1\lang1066\u7841?y tr\f0\lang1033\'ean m\'f4i tr\f3\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7901?ng \f3\'f0\u432?\f1\u7907?c qu\u7843?n l\f0\lang1033\'fd (Managed Code/CLR) v\'e0 ch\f1\lang1066\u7881? cung c\u7845?p l\u7899?p b\u7885?c Process \f3\'f0\f1\u7875? truy xu\u7845?t c\f0\lang1033\'e1c th\'f4ng tin chung qua API h\f1\lang1066\u7879? th\u7889?ng \u7903? m\u7913?c an to\f0\lang1033\'e0n, che gi\f1\lang1066\u7845?u c\f0\lang1033\'e1c c\f1\lang1066\u7845?u tr\f0\lang1033\'fac ph\f1\lang1066\u7847?n c\u7913?ng nh\u7841?y c\u7843?m \f3\'f0\f1\u7875? \f3\'f0\f1\u7843?m b\u7843?o t\f0\lang1033\'ednh b\f1\lang1066\u7843?o m\u7853?t v\f0\lang1033\'e0 \f1\lang1066\u7893?n \f3\'f0\f1\u7883?nh.\par
\par
\b\f0\lang9 2. Kh\'e1c bi\f1\lang1066\u7879?t fork() + exec() (OSTEP) v\f0\lang1033\'e0 CreateProcess (Windows)? N\f1\lang1066\u7871?u \f3\'f0\f0\lang1033\'f3ng OS Workbench ngay sau khi Notepad m\f1\lang1066\u7903?, Notepad c\f0\lang1033\'f3 t\f1\lang1066\u7855?t theo kh\f0\lang1033\'f4ng?\par
\b0 Kh\'e1c bi\f1\lang1066\u7879?t: M\f0\lang1033\'f4 h\'ecnh POSIX d\'f9ng fork() \f3\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7875? nh\f0\lang1033\'e2n b\f1\lang1066\u7843?n to\f0\lang1033\'e0n b\f1\lang1066\u7897? ti\u7871?n tr\f0\lang1033\'ecnh hi\f1\lang1066\u7879?n t\u7841?i th\f0\lang1033\'e0nh ti\f1\lang1066\u7871?n tr\f0\lang1033\'ecnh con (sao ch\'e9p c\f1\lang1066\u7843? kh\f0\lang1033\'f4ng gian \f3\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7883?a ch\u7881?), sau \f3\'f0\f0\lang1033\'f3 d\'f9ng exec() \f3\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7875? \f3\'f0\f0\lang1033\'e8 ch\f3\u432?\u417?ng tr\f0\'ecnh m\f1\lang1066\u7899?i l\f0\lang1033\'ean; trong khi Windows d\'f9ng tr\f1\lang1066\u7921?c ti\u7871?p h\f0\lang1033\'e0m CreateProcess (ho\f1\lang1066\u7863?c Process.Start) \f3\'f0\f1\u7875? kh\u7903?i t\u7841?o m\u7897?t ti\u7871?n tr\f0\lang1033\'ecnh ho\'e0n to\'e0n m\f1\lang1066\u7899?i t\u7915? \f3\'f0\f1\u7847?u v\u7899?i kh\f0\lang1033\'f4ng gian b\f1\lang1066\u7897? nh\u7899? ri\f0\lang1033\'eang bi\f1\lang1066\u7879?t.\par
Notepad c\f0\lang1033\'f3 t\f1\lang1066\u7855?t theo kh\f0\lang1033\'f4ng: Kh\'f4ng. V\'ec Notepad ch\f1\lang1066\u7841?y nh\f3\u432? m\f1\u7897?t ti\u7871?n tr\f0\lang1033\'ecnh \f3\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7897?c l\u7853?p ho\f0\lang1033\'e0n to\'e0n (ti\f1\lang1066\u7871?n tr\f0\lang1033\'ecnh cha m\f1\lang1066\u7865? \f3\'f0\f1\u7897?c l\u7853?p), kh\f0\lang1033\'f4ng b\f1\lang1066\u7883? ph\u7909? thu\u7897?c v\f0\lang1033\'e0o v\'f2ng \f3\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7901?i c\u7911?a ti\u7871?n tr\f0\lang1033\'ecnh OS Workbench sau khi \f3\'f0\f0\'e3 \f3\'f0\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7907?c kh\u7903?i ch\u7841?y th\f0\lang1033\'e0nh c\'f4ng.\par
\b 3. V\'ec sao PID, t\'ean, RAM c\f1\lang1066\u7911?a m\u7897?t s\u7889? ti\u7871?n tr\f0\lang1033\'ecnh l\f1\lang1066\u7841?i b\f0\lang1033\'e1o "(kh\'f4ng c\'f3 quy\f1\lang1066\u7873?n)"? Li\f0\lang1033\'ean h\f1\lang1066\u7879? user mode / kernel mode\par
\b0 M\u7897?t s\u7889? ti\u7871?n tr\f0\lang1033\'ecnh h\f1\lang1066\u7879? th\u7889?ng quan tr\u7885?ng (nh\f3\u432? System, Registry, ho\f1\u7863?c ti\u7871?n tr\f0\lang1033\'ecnh ch\f1\lang1066\u7841?y d\f3\u432?\f1\u7899?i quy\u7873?n Administrator/SYSTEM kh\f0\lang1033\'e1c) \f3\'f0\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7907?c b\u7843?o v\u7879? b\u7903?i ph\f0\lang1033\'e2n quy\f1\lang1066\u7873?n b\u7843?o m\u7853?t c\u7911?a nh\f0\lang1033\'e2n h\f1\lang1066\u7879? \f3\'f0i\f1\u7873?u h\f0\lang1033\'e0nh.\par
Ti\f1\lang1066\u7871?n tr\f0\lang1033\'ecnh \f1\lang1066\u7913?ng d\u7909?ng c\u7911?a ch\f0\lang1033\'fang ta ch\f1\lang1066\u7841?y \u7903? User Mode, trong khi c\f0\lang1033\'e1c ti\f1\lang1066\u7871?n tr\f0\lang1033\'ecnh h\f1\lang1066\u7879? th\u7889?ng \f3\'f0\u432?\f1\u7907?c b\u7843?o v\u7879? \u7903? Kernel Mode. Khi User Mode c\u7889? g\u7855?ng truy xu\u7845?t th\f0\lang1033\'f4ng tin nh\f1\lang1066\u7841?y c\u7843?m c\u7911?a c\f0\lang1033\'e1c ti\f1\lang1066\u7871?n tr\f0\lang1033\'ecnh \f3\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7863?c quy\u7873?n cao, h\u7879? \f3\'f0i\f1\u7873?u h\f0\lang1033\'e0nh s\f1\lang1066\u7869? t\u7915? ch\u7889?i truy c\u7853?p \f3\'f0\f1\u7875? b\u7843?o m\u7853?t h\u7879? th\u7889?ng, g\f0\lang1033\'e2y ra ngo\f1\lang1066\u7841?i l\u7879? v\f0\lang1033\'e0 hi\f1\lang1066\u7875?n th\u7883? l\f0\lang1033\'e0 "(kh\'f4ng c\'f3 quy\f1\lang1066\u7873?n)".\par
\b\f0\lang1033 4. \f1\lang1066 DispatcherTimer c\f0\lang1033\'f3 ph\f1\lang1066\u7843?i "timer interrupt" th\u7853?t c\u7911?a ph\u7847?n c\u7913?ng kh\f0\lang1033\'f4ng? Gi\f1\lang1066\u7889?ng v\f0\lang1033\'e0 kh\'e1c nhau \f1\lang1066\u7903? \f3\'f0\f0\lang1033\'e2u?\par
\b0 Kh\'f4ng. DispatcherTimer l\'e0 m\f1\lang1066\u7897?t b\u7897? h\u7865?n gi\u7901? ph\u7847?n m\u7873?m (software timer) ch\u7841?y \u7903? t\u7847?ng \u7913?ng d\u7909?ng, d\u7921?a v\f0\lang1033\'e0o h\'e0ng \f3\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7907?i th\f0\lang1033\'f4ng \f3\'f0i\f1\lang1066\u7879?p (Dispatcher Message Queue) c\u7911?a lu\u7891?ng giao di\u7879?n UI Thread.\par
Gi\u7889?ng nhau: \f3\'d0\f1\u7873?u d\f0\lang1033\'f9ng \f3\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7875? k\f0\lang1033\'edch ho\f1\lang1066\u7841?t m\u7897?t \f3\'f0o\f1\u7841?n m\f0\lang1033\'e3 ho\f1\lang1066\u7863?c s\u7921? ki\u7879?n l\u7863?p l\u7841?i sau nh\u7919?ng kho\u7843?ng th\u7901?i gian nh\u7845?t \f3\'f0\f1\u7883?nh.\par
Kh\f0\lang1033\'e1c nhau: Timer interrupt ph\f1\lang1066\u7847?n c\u7913?ng do chip ng\u7855?t ph\u7847?n c\u7913?ng (PIT/APIC) g\f0\lang1033\'e2y ra, bu\f1\lang1066\u7897?c CPU d\u7915?ng c\f0\lang1033\'f4ng vi\f1\lang1066\u7879?c hi\u7879?n t\u7841?i ngay l\u7853?p t\u7913?c \f3\'f0\f1\u7875? x\u7917? l\f0\lang1033\'fd ng\f1\lang1066\u7855?t; c\f0\lang1033\'f2n DispatcherTimer ph\f1\lang1066\u7843?i x\u7871?p h\f0\lang1033\'e0ng ch\f1\lang1066\u7901? CPU r\u7843?nh r\u7895?i v\f0\lang1033\'e0 x\f1\lang1066\u7917? l\f0\lang1033\'fd qua v\'f2ng l\f1\lang1066\u7863?p th\f0\lang1033\'f4ng \f3\'f0i\f1\lang1066\u7879?p (Message Loop) c\u7911?a WPF.\par
\b Ph\u7847?n B \f2\emdash  Thread & an to\f0\lang1033\'e0n th\'f4ng tin\par
1. "T\f1\lang1066\u7841?o ti\u7871?n tr\f0\lang1033\'ecnh con" v\'e0 "10 Thread n\f1\lang1066\u7873?n" kh\f0\lang1033\'e1c nhau c\f1\lang1066\u7889?t l\f0\lang1033\'f5i v\f1\lang1066\u7873? kh\f0\lang1033\'f4ng gian b\f1\lang1066\u7897? nh\u7899? th\u7871? n\f0\lang1033\'e0o?\par
\b0 T\f1\lang1066\u7841?o ti\u7871?n tr\f0\lang1033\'ecnh con (notepad.exe): T\f1\lang1066\u7841?o ra m\u7897?t kh\f0\lang1033\'f4ng gian b\f1\lang1066\u7897? nh\u7899? ho\f0\lang1033\'e0n to\'e0n m\f1\lang1066\u7899?i, \f3\'f0\f1\u7897?c l\u7853?p ho\f0\lang1033\'e0n to\'e0n v\f1\lang1066\u7873? RAM, b\u7843?ng m\f0\lang1033\'f4 t\f1\lang1066\u7843? file v\f0\lang1033\'e0 t\'e0i nguy\'ean so v\f1\lang1066\u7899?i ti\u7871?n tr\f0\lang1033\'ecnh cha.\par
T\f1\lang1066\u7841?o 10 Thread n\u7873?n: C\f0\lang1033\'e1c thread n\'e0y n\f1\lang1066\u7857?m chung b\f0\lang1033\'ean trong kh\'f4ng gian b\f1\lang1066\u7897? nh\u7899? c\u7911?a ti\u7871?n tr\f0\lang1033\'ecnh OSWorkbench, chia s\f1\lang1066\u7867? chung heap, bi\u7871?n to\f0\lang1033\'e0n c\f1\lang1066\u7909?c v\f0\lang1033\'e0 m\'e3 ngu\f1\lang1066\u7891?n, ch\u7881? c\u7845?p ph\f0\lang1033\'e1t ri\'eang v\'f9ng nh\f1\lang1066\u7899? Stack v\f0\lang1033\'e0 thanh ghi cho m\f1\lang1066\u7895?i thread.\par
\b\f0\lang1033 2. \f1\lang1066 V\f0\lang1033\'ec sao s\f1\lang1066\u7889? thread b\u7845?t th\f3\u432?\f1\u7901?ng l\f0\lang1033\'e0 t\'edn hi\f1\lang1066\u7879?u \f3\'f0\f0\lang1033\'e1ng ch\'fa \'fd v\f1\lang1066\u7899?i c\f0\lang1033\'f4ng c\f1\lang1066\u7909? EDR?\par
\b0 C\f0\lang1033\'e1c ph\f1\lang1066\u7847?n m\u7873?m \f3\'f0\f1\u7897?c h\u7841?i (malware) ho\u7863?c m\f0\lang1033\'e3 khai th\'e1c th\f3\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7901?ng s\u7917? d\u7909?ng k\u7929? thu\u7853?t t\u7841?o ra h\f0\lang1033\'e0ng lo\f1\lang1066\u7841?t thread \u7849?n (thread injection ho\u7863?c multi-threaded scanning/brute-forcing) \f3\'f0\f1\u7875? th\u7921?c hi\u7879?n c\f0\lang1033\'e1c t\'e1c v\f1\lang1066\u7909? \f3\'f0\f1\u7897?c h\u7841?i ng\u7847?m.\par
Do \f3\'f0\f0\lang1033\'f3, l\f3\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7907?ng thread t\f3\'e3ng v\f1\u7885?t b\u7845?t th\f3\u432?\f1\u7901?ng trong m\u7897?t ti\u7871?n tr\f0\lang1033\'ecnh b\'ecnh th\f3\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7901?ng l\f0\lang1033\'e0 m\f1\lang1066\u7897?t d\u7845?u hi\u7879?u h\f0\lang1033\'e0nh vi (heuristic indicator) quan tr\f1\lang1066\u7885?ng \f3\'f0\f1\u7875? c\f0\lang1033\'e1c c\'f4ng c\f1\lang1066\u7909? EDR \f3\'f0\f0\lang1033\'e1nh d\f1\lang1066\u7845?u c\u7847?n gi\f0\lang1033\'e1m s\'e1t s\'e2u h\f3\u417?n.\par
\b\f0 3. \f3\'d0\f0\'e3 th\f1\lang1066\u7845?y ti\u7871?n tr\f0\lang1033\'ecnh h\f1\lang1066\u7907?p ph\f0\lang1033\'e1p n\'e0o v\f3\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7907?t ng\f3\u432?\f1\u7905?ng 50? V\f0\lang1033\'ec sao d\'f9ng ch\f1\lang1066\u7919? "c\u7847?n xem x\f0\lang1033\'e9t k\f1\lang1066\u7929? h\f3\u417?n" thay v\f0\lang1033\'ec "\f3\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7897?c h\u7841?i"?\par
\b0 Ti\u7871?n tr\f0\lang1033\'ecnh h\f1\lang1066\u7907?p ph\f0\lang1033\'e1p: C\'e1c tr\'ecnh duy\f1\lang1066\u7879?t web l\u7899?n (Chrome, Edge), ph\u7847?n m\u7873?m bi\f0\lang1033\'ean d\f1\lang1066\u7883?ch (Visual Studio), ho\u7863?c c\f0\lang1033\'e1c \f1\lang1066\u7913?ng d\u7909?ng \f3\'f0a lu\f1\u7891?ng n\u7863?ng (nh\f3\u432? ph\f1\u7847?n m\u7873?m d\u7921?ng h\f0\lang1033\'ecnh, game) th\f3\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7901?ng xuy\f0\lang1033\'ean v\f3\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7907?t ng\f3\u432?\f1\u7905?ng 50 thread do b\u7843?n ch\u7845?t x\u7917? l\f0\lang1033\'fd song song.\par
L\'fd do d\'f9ng t\f1\lang1066\u7915? "c\u7847?n xem x\f0\lang1033\'e9t k\f1\lang1066\u7929? h\f3\u417?n": S\f1\u7889? l\f3\u432?\f1\u7907?ng thread nhi\u7873?u ch\u7881? l\f0\lang1033\'e0 d\f1\lang1066\u7845?u hi\u7879?u c\u7843?nh b\f0\lang1033\'e1o h\'e0nh vi (suspicious signal), kh\'f4ng ph\f1\lang1066\u7843?i l\f0\lang1033\'fac n\'e0o c\f3\u361?ng l\f0\'e0 m\'e3 \f3\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7897?c. C\u7847?n th\f0\lang1033\'eam c\'e1c t\'edn hi\f1\lang1066\u7879?u kh\f0\lang1033\'e1c (nh\f3\u432? k\f1\lang1066\u7871?t n\u7889?i m\u7841?ng l\u7841?, ghi file h\u7879? th\u7889?ng b\u7845?t th\f3\u432?\f1\u7901?ng) \f3\'f0\f1\u7875? k\u7871?t lu\u7853?n ch\f0\lang1033\'ednh x\'e1c.\par
\b 4. V\'ec sao d\'f9ng SafeRead cho t\f1\lang1066\u7915?ng th\f0\lang1033\'f4ng tin, thay v\'ec m\f1\lang1066\u7897?t try/catch b\u7885?c c\u7843? ti\u7871?n tr\f0\lang1033\'ecnh/thread?\par
\b0 N\f1\lang1066\u7871?u d\f0\lang1033\'f9ng m\f1\lang1066\u7897?t kh\u7889?i try/catch b\u7885?c b\f0\lang1033\'ean ngo\'e0i to\'e0n b\f1\lang1066\u7897? v\f0\lang1033\'f2ng l\f1\lang1066\u7863?p \f3\'f0\f1\u7885?c ti\u7871?n tr\f0\lang1033\'ecnh ho\f1\lang1066\u7863?c thread, khi g\u7863?p quy\u7873?n truy c\u7853?p b\u7883? t\u7915? ch\u7889?i \u7903? m\u7897?t thu\u7897?c t\f0\lang1033\'ednh b\f1\lang1066\u7845?t k\u7923? (v\f0\lang1033\'ed d\f1\lang1066\u7909?: StartTime), to\f0\lang1033\'e0n b\f1\lang1066\u7897? ti\u7871?n tr\f0\lang1033\'ecnh ho\f1\lang1066\u7863?c thread \f3\'f0\f0\lang1033\'f3 s\f1\lang1066\u7869? b\u7883? b\u7887? qua l\u7853?p t\u7913?c, d\u7851?n \f3\'f0\f1\u7871?n m\u7845?t s\u7841?ch c\f0\lang1033\'e1c th\'f4ng tin kh\'e1c c\'f3 th\f1\lang1066\u7875? \f3\'f0\f1\u7885?c \f3\'f0\u432?\f1\u7907?c.\par
D\f0\lang1033\'f9ng SafeRead ri\'eang l\f1\lang1066\u7867? cho t\u7915?ng thu\u7897?c t\f0\lang1033\'ednh gi\'fap c\'f4 l\f1\lang1066\u7853?p l\u7895?i, \f3\'f0\f1\u7843?m b\u7843?o c\f0\lang1033\'e1c thu\f1\lang1066\u7897?c t\f0\lang1033\'ednh kh\'e1c v\f1\lang1066\u7851?n \f3\'f0\u432?\f1\u7907?c thu th\u7853?p th\f0\lang1033\'e0nh c\'f4ng.\par
\b Ph\f1\lang1066\u7847?n C \f2\emdash  Priority & CPU\par
\f0\lang1033 1. Ghi l\f1\lang1066\u7841?i %CPU c\u7911?a hai c\u7917?a s\u7893? trong th\f0\lang1033\'ed nghi\f1\lang1066\u7879?m 1 v\f0\lang1033\'e0 2. Gi\f1\lang1066\u7843?i th\f0\lang1033\'edch b\f1\lang1066\u7857?ng b\u7897? l\u7853?p l\u7883?ch.\par
\b0 Khi c\f0\lang1033\'e1c ti\f1\lang1066\u7871?n tr\f0\lang1033\'ecnh ch\f1\lang1066\u7841?y \u7903? \f3\'f0\f1\u7897? \f3\u432?u ti\f0\lang1033\'ean Normal, b\f1\lang1066\u7897? l\u7853?p l\u7883?ch ph\f0\lang1033\'e2n b\f1\lang1066\u7893? th\u7901?i gian CPU \f3\'f0\f1\u7873?u \f3\'f0\f1\u7863?n; khi m\u7897?t ti\u7871?n tr\f0\lang1033\'ecnh \f3\'f0\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7907?c n\f0\lang1033\'e2ng \f3\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7897? \f3\u432?u ti\f0\lang1033\'ean l\'ean cao h\f3\u417?n, n\f0\'f3 nh\f1\lang1066\u7853?n \f3\'f0\u432?\f1\u7907?c nhi\u7873?u l\f0\lang1033\'e1t c\f1\lang1066\u7855?t th\u7901?i gian (time slices) h\f3\u417?n t\f1\u7915? CPU, khi\u7871?n %CPU c\u7911?a c\u7917?a s\u7893? \f3\'f0\f0\lang1033\'f3 t\f3\'e3ng l\f0\'ean r\'f5 r\f1\lang1066\u7879?t.\par
\b\f0\lang1033 2. Trong th\'ed nghi\f1\lang1066\u7879?m 2, c\u7917?a s\u7893? Idle th\f3\u432?\f1\u7901?ng kh\f0\lang1033\'f4ng v\f1\lang1066\u7873? \f3\'f0\f0\lang1033\'fang 0%. V\'ec sao?\par
\b0 Do h\f1\lang1066\u7879? \f3\'f0i\f1\u7873?u h\f0\lang1033\'e0nh Windows lu\'f4n ch\f1\lang1066\u7841?y ng\u7847?m r\u7845?t nhi\u7873?u ti\u7871?n tr\f0\lang1033\'ecnh h\f1\lang1066\u7879? th\u7889?ng, d\u7883?ch v\u7909? n\u7873?n (background services) v\f0\lang1033\'e0 c\'e1c t\'e1c v\f1\lang1066\u7909? qu\u7843?n l\f0\lang1033\'fd c\f1\lang1066\u7917?a s\u7893?, do \f3\'f0\f0\lang1033\'f3 CPU kh\'f4ng bao gi\f1\lang1066\u7901? ho\f0\lang1033\'e0n to\'e0n r\f1\lang1066\u7843?nh r\u7895?i tuy\u7879?t \f3\'f0\f1\u7889?i 0%. T\f3\u432?\u417?ng t\f1\u7921? c\f3\u417? ch\f1\u7871? priority boost trong OSTEP ch\f3\u432?\u417?ng 8, h\f1\u7879? th\u7889?ng \f3\'f0\f1\u7883?nh k\u7923? c\u7845?p ph\f0\lang1033\'e1t quy\f1\lang1066\u7873?n \f3\u432?u ti\f0\lang1033\'ean \f3\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7875? tr\f0\lang1033\'e1nh hi\f1\lang1066\u7879?n t\f3\u432?\f1\u7907?ng \f3\'f0\f0\lang1033\'f3i t\'e0i nguy\'ean (starvation).\par
\b 3. N\f1\lang1066\u7871?u ch\u7881? ch\u7841?y m\u7897?t c\u7917?a s\u7893? Burner \u7903? m\u7913?c Idle, %CPU c\f0\lang1033\'f3 gi\f1\lang1066\u7843?m so v\u7899?i Normal kh\f0\lang1033\'f4ng? V\'ec sao \f3\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7897? \f3\u432?u ti\f0\lang1033\'ean ch\f1\lang1066\u7881? c\f0\lang1033\'f3 t\'e1c d\f1\lang1066\u7909?ng khi c\f0\lang1033\'f3 tranh ch\f1\lang1066\u7845?p CPU?\par
\b0 C\f0\lang1033\'f3 gi\f1\lang1066\u7843?m ho\u7863?c kh\f0\lang1033\'f4ng tranh ch\f1\lang1066\u7845?p: N\u7871?u ch\u7881? c\f0\lang1033\'f3 duy nh\f1\lang1066\u7845?t m\u7897?t ti\u7871?n tr\f0\lang1033\'ecnh chi\f1\lang1066\u7871?m CPU, n\f0\lang1033\'f3 s\f1\lang1066\u7869? d\f0\lang1033\'f9ng to\'e0n b\f1\lang1066\u7897? t\f0\lang1033\'e0i nguy\'ean r\f1\lang1066\u7843?nh r\u7895?i n\f0\lang1033\'ean m\f1\lang1066\u7913?c \f3\'f0\f1\u7897? \f3\u432?u ti\f0\lang1033\'ean cao hay th\f1\lang1066\u7845?p kh\f0\lang1033\'f4ng l\'e0m thay \f3\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7893?i l\f3\u432?\f1\u7907?ng CPU n\f0\lang1033\'f3 nh\f1\lang1066\u7853?n \f3\'f0\u432?\f1\u7907?c.\par
\f3\'d0\f1\u7897? \f3\u432?u ti\f0\lang1033\'ean ch\f1\lang1066\u7881? th\u7875? hi\u7879?n r\f0\lang1033\'f5 quy\f1\lang1066\u7873?n tranh ch\u7845?p khi c\f0\lang1033\'f3 nhi\f1\lang1066\u7873?u ti\u7871?n tr\f0\lang1033\'ecnh c\'f9ng tranh gi\'e0nh CPU c\'f9ng l\'fac, l\'fac \f3\'f0\f0\'f3 b\f1\lang1066\u7897? l\u7853?p l\u7883?ch m\u7899?i d\u7921?a v\f0\lang1033\'e0o \f3\u432?u ti\f0\'ean \f3\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7875? quy\u7871?t \f3\'f0\f1\u7883?nh c\u7845?p CPU cho b\f0\lang1033\'ean n\'e0o tr\f3\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7899?c.\par
\b\f0\lang1033 4. V\'ec sao b\'e0i lab kh\'f4ng cho ch\f1\lang1066\u7885?n RealTime? \f3\'d0i\f1\u7873?u g\f0\lang1033\'ec x\f1\lang1066\u7843?y ra n\u7871?u v\f0\lang1033\'f2ng l\f1\lang1066\u7863?p b\u7853?n ch\u7841?y \u7903? m\u7913?c \f3\'f0\f0\lang1033\'f3?\par
\b0 M\f1\lang1066\u7913?c \f3\u432?u ti\f0\lang1033\'ean RealTime cao h\f3\u417?n c\f1\lang1066\u7843? c\f0\lang1033\'e1c ti\f1\lang1066\u7871?n tr\f0\lang1033\'ecnh c\f1\lang1066\u7889?t l\f0\lang1033\'f5i c\f1\lang1066\u7911?a h\u7879? th\u7889?ng \f3\'f0i\f1\u7873?u h\f0\lang1033\'e0nh.\par
N\f1\lang1066\u7871?u m\u7897?t ti\u7871?n tr\f0\lang1033\'ecnh ng\f3\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7901?i d\f0\lang1033\'f9ng ch\f1\lang1066\u7841?y v\f0\lang1033\'f2ng l\f1\lang1066\u7863?p b\u7853?n (busy-waiting) \u7903? m\u7913?c RealTime, n\f0\lang1033\'f3 s\f1\lang1066\u7869? chi\u7871?m tr\u7885?n v\u7865?n CPU, khi\u7871?n h\u7879? \f3\'f0i\f1\u7873?u h\f0\lang1033\'e0nh kh\'f4ng th\f1\lang1066\u7875? x\u7917? l\f0\lang1033\'fd c\'e1c t\'e1c v\f1\lang1066\u7909? chu\u7897?t, b\f0\lang1033\'e0n ph\'edm hay ng\f1\lang1066\u7855?t h\u7879? th\u7889?ng, d\u7851?n \f3\'f0\f1\u7871?n hi\u7879?n t\f3\u432?\f1\u7907?ng \f3\'f0\u417? c\f1\u7913?ng to\f0\lang1033\'e0n b\f1\lang1066\u7897? m\f0\lang1033\'e1y t\'ednh (freeze/crash).\lang9\par
